    "description": "Are you a skilled Subject Matter Expert looking for your next big career move? VIT University South Asia Partners in Tiruchirappalli offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout VIT University South Asia Partners:\nVIT University South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Monitor student progress and provide timely feedback\n• Design formative and summative assessments aligned to learning objectives\n• Develop and deliver engaging lesson plans for students\n• Participate in teacher training and professional development programs\n• Conduct parent-teacher meetings and update parents on student performance\n• Contribute to school newsletter, blogs, and other publications\n• Support students with special educational needs\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• CA / CMA / CFA certification\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Communication Skills\n• Proficiency in Data Analysis\n• Proficiency in Student Assessment\n• Proficiency in LMS Platforms\n• Proficiency in Classroom Management\n• Proficiency in Zoom/Teams\n• Proficiency in Child Psychology\n• Proficiency in Bloom's Taxonomy\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Flexible working hours\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Life and accident insurance\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Tiruchirappalli, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with VIT University South Asia Partners!",
